  "What is the function of the Program Counter (PC) register?\nA. A type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-green-500 bg-green-50/50 shadow-2xs\" disabled> A Stores the address of the current instruction\nB. B type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> B Stores interrupt priority levels\nC. C type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> C Stores temporary arithmetic data\nD. D type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> D Stores stack frame data\nA",
  "What technique allows digital signals to simulate analog output by varying the ratio of ON and OFF time?\nA. A type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-red-500 bg-red-50/50 shadow-2xs\" disabled> A Analog modulation\nB. B type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-green-500 bg-green-50/50 shadow-2xs\" disabled> B Pulse Width Modulation (PWM)\nC. C type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> C Frequency division\nD. D type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> D Interrupt scheduling\nB",
